Ontology Hub Platform & Infrastructure Team
Responsible for building and maintaining the Ontology Hub platform infrastructure, website development, and MOBI integration. This team manages platform updates, ensures system stability, handles technical architecture, and maintains the infrastructure that enables ontology storage, retrieval, and distribution across the organization.


MBDT PCC – Enterprise Ontology Stewardship & Development Team:
Responsible for ensuring ontologies across the organization align with the enterprise ontology. The team develops select ontologies end-to-end, while also reviewing, guiding, and supporting other teams in their ontology development. They curate featured ontologies and provide content including articles, tutorials, patterns, and project documentation.
